lesson: 223
title: Days in the months
level: primary-3
stars: 0
explain: January, March, May, July, August, October and December have 31 days; April, June, September and November have 30; February has 28, or 29 in a leap year.
explain: Count the knuckles and the gaps between them on your fist: every knuckle month has 31 days.
explain: Today is July 20. The days of July after today are 31 − 20 = 11 days.
vars: a=name d=3..28
answer: 31 - d
exercise: Today is July {d}. How many days of July are left after today?
exercise: It is March {d}. How many more days of March are there after today?
exercise: {a} arrives at the seaside on August {d} and leaves on the last day of August. How many nights does {a.he} stay?
exercise: A calendar shows October {d}. How many days come after it until the end of October?
exercise: The library books are borrowed on May {d} and must be back on the last day of May. How many days later is that?
exercise: {a} counts the days left in December after December {d}. How many days does {a.he} count?
exercise: its jan {d} today, how many days left in january
exercise: {a} says it's March {d+2}, no wait, March {d}. how many days left in March after today
exercise: dad says only {30-d} days left in august after today, its aug {d}. nah right? how many really
exercise: may {d} now, school trip on may 31, how many days to go
exercise: december {d}, how many days til new year's eve
test: How many days remain in October once October {d} is over?
test: {a} feeds a neighbour's cat every day from the day after July {d} to the end of July. On how many days does {a.he} feed the cat?
test: The last day of May is a holiday. It is May {d} today. In how many days is the holiday?
test: From the morning of January {d} to the morning of the last day of January is how many days?
test: how many days of aug left after the {d.ord}
test: its the {d.ord} of dec, how many days of december still to come after today
test: {a}'s grandad turns {d+50} on the last day of March, and today is March {d}. In how many days is his birthday?
exam: Given that the present date is the {d.ordwords} of July, determine the number of days of the said month which remain subsequent to the present date.
exam: Ascertain the number of calendar days which elapse between the {d.ord} of December and the final day of December.
exam: A lodging is occupied from the {d.ord} of August until the last day of that month. State the number of nights for which the lodging is occupied.
exam: Compute the number of days of the month of March which follow the {d.ord} of March.
exercise: Dad was "let go" on July {d}, but he is paid until the end of July. For how many days of July after that is he still paid?
exercise: teacher says my project's "not quite there yet", aka it's crap. due July 31, today's July {d}. how many days i got after today
test: Our goldfish "went to the big pond in the sky" on the {d.ord} of August. How many days of August were left after that day?
